url: 'https://imaging-plaza.epfl.ch'
repository: 'https://zenodo.org/records/21889057'
abstract: >-
  Imaging Plaza is a curated catalog of FAIR (Findable,
  Accessible, Interoperable, and Reusable) imaging software
  from across research domains and scales. It helps
  researchers discover, evaluate, and access imaging tools
  through AI-powered search, a FAIR-level framework,
  structured metadata, and runnable examples. Unlike a
  source-code repository, Imaging Plaza provides a curated
  entry point for navigating imaging software and research
  outputs from Switzerland and beyond. Imaging Plaza is a
  joint endeavor of the EPFL Center for Imaging and the
  Swiss Data Science Center (SDSC). Its development was
  supported by an EPFL Open Science Grant and an ETH ORD
  Explore Grant, with part of the project funded by PHRT.
